                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                        %mi b
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} s(b)
                  be the least element in
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi p
                          %mrow
                            %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                            %mn 1
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
